  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/326610757/v3.10.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-09T01:45:51Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/releases/tag/v3.10.0"/>
    <title>Release v3.10.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;🚀 Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(model-routing)&lt;/strong&gt; centralize routes in YAML and expose supported languages (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5521873572&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/741&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/741/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/741&quot;&gt;#741&lt;/a&gt;) by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/75946b1d2684db4dff77bbdbf2c0555a1d17eade&quot;&gt;75946b1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(models)&lt;/strong&gt; add multilingual model routing and licensing metadata. (issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5380848820&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/739&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/739/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/739&quot;&gt;#739&lt;/a&gt;) by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/4a3070f304467e6d426e78a82afea5cb1181f305&quot;&gt;4a3070f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;support loading raw memory image buffers with format and stride metadata by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/deea2a03e670bfbcbe06536d4df75cd20ec7f6f9&quot;&gt;deea2a0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;support decoding images from memory addresses (issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5380801595&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/738&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/738/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/738&quot;&gt;#738&lt;/a&gt;) by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/64b1c680be9992b7500aecd89a484d161443612a&quot;&gt;64b1c68&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;validate python-bidi before initializing Arabic OCR (issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5044379680&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/719&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/719/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/719&quot;&gt;#719&lt;/a&gt;) by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/0e629c8be05635035c01a829d10a91bbcd56a27a&quot;&gt;0e629c8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(det)&lt;/strong&gt; honour limit_side_len when limit_type is max (issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5500298413&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/740&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/740/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/740&quot;&gt;#740&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5588872226&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/742&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/742/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/742&quot;&gt;#742&lt;/a&gt;) by Mohammad Hijjawi in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/f65c7da00e72c19c258245e8e0e5f33af14488be&quot;&gt;f65c7da&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(mnn)&lt;/strong&gt; use getNumpyData() instead of getData() for output extraction (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5003512035&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/717&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/717/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/717&quot;&gt;#717&lt;/a&gt;) by Horatiu George Todoran in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/667d04c02998e7d5256a9369ecbf9da94a4e1c95&quot;&gt;667d04c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(nrtr)&lt;/strong&gt; let generate_square_subsequent_mask take the device it is given (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5333752632&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/731&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/731/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/731&quot;&gt;#731&lt;/a&gt;) by Tai An in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/09f4e3b185de0074de94d4e9c26a3ca2fb67fa8f&quot;&gt;09f4e3b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(pytorch)&lt;/strong&gt; require PyTorch 1.13+ for secure model loading by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/e7edb012372f9ec5cf9e38a1e1e7b6abd489a2e7&quot;&gt;e7edb01&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(rec)&lt;/strong&gt; honour model_root_dir for the rec dict and str paths in torch engine (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5752247847&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/752&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/752/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/752&quot;&gt;#752&lt;/a&gt;) by Rett Wilson in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/332b4fcc235bf7734df01527e35dde66f8d0d25b&quot;&gt;332b4fc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;correct model SHA256 by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/bd941dae09da793e76c6ba15c7aaf40f8424232a&quot;&gt;bd941da&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;load torch weights with weights_only=True to prevent code execution (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5251529447&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/728&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/728/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/728&quot;&gt;#728&lt;/a&gt;) by Patrick Chilton in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/1087d4a6ec08ee49e6dfe9f3813a9e76f0ce1127&quot;&gt;1087d4a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;lock lazy model load so first use constructs once (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5206476888&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/725&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/725/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/pull/725&quot;&gt;#725&lt;/a&gt;) by Yuzhong Zhang in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/486ec538d3c5196ff95864f501bc56916dcf4ba5&quot;&gt;486ec53&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;update star-history chart by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/dd48f2d7be03d7bb4f38b2783a45775f001ced76&quot;&gt;dd48f2d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 Other&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(python)&lt;/strong&gt; make OpenCV headless by default with optional GUI support (issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5367629518&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/737&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/737/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/737&quot;&gt;#737&lt;/a&gt;) by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/c1ec6054a7c36ebb25962a4884a5430212b7756f&quot;&gt;c1ec605&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;📚 Documentation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add Backer by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/549847df506a32421086d2a08d19646ee958a6e0&quot;&gt;549847d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add Backer by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/8eb4aaef9f032a5b7c5b19443498156e4ab37f75&quot;&gt;8eb4aae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;⚡ Performance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;lazily initialize OCR models by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/0ad7c04d8cc4003ad9add23691864807b2ca0a31&quot;&gt;0ad7c04&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;remove optional OpenCV dependency by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/d6e304be35e60610d717e70120525e1cb384b9b1&quot;&gt;d6e304b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;update sponsor way by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/9936171fa42eb4ca4d900941c827c80f6847535b&quot;&gt;9936171&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ignore bundled OCR model files by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/cbea36ab3df61bc681216411c25c407ee7e0ed18&quot;&gt;cbea36a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;update pre-commit configuration by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/9ceb3420f551643d6daaf2ae9e06d09c37edca6a&quot;&gt;9ceb342&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;update star-tracker range by SWHL in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/3efd66a6ba32ff6b7ae1c7a36b8a3cb54c93e53c&quot;&gt;3efd66a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎉 Contributors&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RettWilson22&quot;&gt;@RettWilson22&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/MohammadHijjawi97&quot;&gt;@MohammadHijjawi97&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Anai-Guo&quot;&gt;@Anai-Guo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/chpatrick&quot;&gt;@chpatrick&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/BetterAndBetterII&quot;&gt;@BetterAndBetterII&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/todorangrg&quot;&gt;@todorangrg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;:  &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/compare/v3.9.2..v3.10.0&quot;&gt;3.10.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
