  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/326610757/v3.9.2</id>
    <updated>2026-07-21T10:53:34Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/releases/tag/v3.9.2"/>
    <title>Release v3.9.2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;🚀 Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add use_preprocess_img and use_vertical_padding logic by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/3cc33f8d54950d4e81106643bb99a920eb795125&quot;&gt;3cc33f8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add use_preprocess_img and use_apply_vertical_padding parameter by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/83866d6a5cf0002db1abfb426796b88213035f78&quot;&gt;83866d6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;verify RapidOCR model accuracy under TensorRT inference engine. Details in blog: &lt;a href=&quot;https://link.wtturl.cn/?target=https%3A%2F%2Frapidai.github.io%2FRapidOCRDocs%2Flatest%2Fblog%2F2026%2F07%2F05%2Fsupport-pp-ocrv6-tensorrt-engine%2F&amp;amp;scene=im&amp;amp;aid=497858&amp;amp;lang=zh&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;RapidOCR PP-OCRv6 Supports TensorRT Inference Engine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;improve IDE support for lazy package exports by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/096293330eb0e96700e3775ab7b7166cdbb385fd&quot;&gt;0962933&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fixed issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4715499842&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/695&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/695/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/695&quot;&gt;#695&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/0fa7a9664c61de5a07d4fcb1a81e296f6764a691&quot;&gt;0fa7a96&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fixed issue &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4820611382&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/709&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/709/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/issues/709&quot;&gt;#709&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/802c05647f705cb225b637533d303e137fa38922&quot;&gt;802c056&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;align the performance of the torch version of the PP-OCRv6 Rec tiny model by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/b64a46ffd4fc370e4e2c5a10c485cb26e40b8b0f&quot;&gt;b64a46f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧪 Testing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;remove invalid unit testings of tensorrt module by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/c4db82f7aca76404a56c514f62b2d2df735a3288&quot;&gt;c4db82f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add PP-OCRv3 mobile unit testings by &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/SWHL&quot;&gt;@SWHL&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR/commit/bce0c99be9914e7df9a7590a68a65056a8b78438&quot;&gt;bce0c99&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
